   "kind": "correctness",
   "part": 1,
   "pin": null,
   "question": "",
   "quote": "ThreadOpenConnections() still consumes m_anchors while networking is disabled. It pops an address before calling OpenNetworkConnection(), which then returns because fNetworkActive is false.",
